   The total number of eggs painted by all four students is 56:
   \[
   x + x + 21 + y = 56 \\
   2x + 21 + 9 = 56 \\
   2x + 30 = 56 \\
   2x = 26 \\
   x = 13
   \]

7. **Calculate the difference:**
   \[
