Solving for \( x \):
\[ 6x + 7 = 37 \]
\[ 6x = 28 \]
\[ x = \frac{28}{6} = \frac{14}{3} \]
The length of the red rope is \( 4 \times \frac{14}{3} = \frac{56}{3} \) centimeters.
